<title>USA: NOTICE OF SALE - Pinelands Board of Education, NJ.</title>
<headline>NOTICE OF SALE - Pinelands Board of Education, NJ.</headline>
<text>
<p>SUMMARY NOTICE OF SALE</p>
<p>				  $9,025,000*</p>
<p>		 Pinelands Regional Board of Education</p>
<p>		    (Ocean and Burlington Counties)</p>
<p>				  New Jersey</p>
<p>	   General Obligation School Bonds, Series 1997</p>
<p>			   Dated January 1, 1997</p>
<p>		    Book-Entry-Only, Bank Qualified</p>
<p>Sealed bids January 9, 1997 at 11:00 A.M. (EST) Bonds are not subject to redemption prior to maturity Authorized denominations of $5,000  and integral multiples thereof Due August 15th</p>
<p>YearPrincipal AmountYearPrincipal Amount</p>
<p>	1997    $715,000    2002    $915,000</p>
<p>	1998    775,000     2003    955,000</p>
<p>	1999    810,000     2004    995,000</p>
<p>	2000    840,000     2005   1,045,000</p>
<p>	2001    880,000     2006   1,095,000</p>
<p>Legal Opinion: Gentile &amp; Turpen, Flemington, New Jersey Closing Date: January 21, 1997 at the offices of Gentile &amp; Turpen, 152 Main  Street, Flemington,  NJ 08822.  Certified, Treasurer's or Cashier's check for 2%  of the par amount  of Bonds due with bid.</p>
<p>Additional information on  the Bond  sale may  be obtained from Philip G.  Gentile, Esq.,  Gentile &amp;  Turpen, 152  Main Street, Flemington, NJ 08822 (908) 284-2474.</p>
<p>*Preliminary, subject to change</p>
<p>			  (From The Bond Buyer)</p>
